            "speakerName": "Zhihua",
            "text": "Argh, I need to take a breather..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134001",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Herbalist Gui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413401101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413401101": {
            "id": "413401101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "So I'm afraid it's all up to you for now, Traveler.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413401102"
            ]
          },
          "413401102": {
            "id": "413401102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Got it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413401103"
            ]
          },
          "413401103": {
            "id": "413401103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Thank you. Here's the medicine. Please get them to Guanhai and Zhihua as quickly as you can."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134003",
      "subQuestName": "Deliver medicine to the people in the area",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400201": {
            "id": "413400201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zhihua",
            "text": "Ugh, I must've eaten something that didn't agree with me...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400202"
            ]
          },
          "413400202": {
            "id": "413400202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here's some medicine from Herbalist Gui...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400203"
            ]
          },
          "413400203": {
            "id": "413400203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zhihua",
            "text": "Oh, thank you. This is that stomach medicine I asked him for, isn't it? I think I might be getting indigestion... my stomach's feeling mighty terrible right now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400204"
            ]
          },
          "413400204": {
            "id": "413400204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zhihua",
            "text": "I was just strolling through the city streets, having a bite to eat here and there, and before I knew it, I'd overeaten ...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400205"
            ]
          },
          "413400205": {
            "id": "413400205",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What did you eat...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400206"
            ]
          },
          "413400206": {
            "id": "413400206",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zhihua",
            "text": "Hmm, fried rice, raw fish, some fruit, lots and lots of shrimp... Ah yes, and some excellent wine!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400209"
            ]
          },
          "413400209": {
            "id": "413400209",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zhihua",
            "text": "Well, that's what medicine is for, isn't it? Think about it — what's the point of a festival if you can't eat whatever you like?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400210"
            ]
          },
          "413400210": {
            "id": "413400210",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Zhihua",
            "text": "Thanks for bringing the medicine, either way. I should probably take this opportunity to rest as well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134004",
      "subQuestName": "Deliver medicine to the people in the area",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400301": {
            "id": "413400301",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Ow, ow, ow... It hurts... Excuse me? D—Did you want something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400302"
            ]
          },
          "413400302": {
            "id": "413400302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here's some medicine from Herbalist Gui...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400303"
            ]
          },
          "413400303": {
            "id": "413400303",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Wow, thanks! Just what I ordered... Fast turnaround time, I must say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400304"
            ]
          },
          "413400304": {
            "id": "413400304",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Ahh, I feel better already. Must've caught a chill last night from the sea breeze, I'll wager...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400305"
            ]
          },
          "413400305": {
            "id": "413400305",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No indigestion for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400306"
            ]
          },
          "413400306": {
            "id": "413400306",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Hah, indigestion? Me? I'll have you know that I have an iron stomach — why, I ate three grilled fish in one sitting for my last meal!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400307"
            ]
          },
          "413400307": {
            "id": "413400307",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Even now, not one of my friends can match my prowess at eating and drinking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400308"
            ]
          },
          "413400308": {
            "id": "413400308",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Alright, enough about that. I'd better finish this medicine real quick — I've got a drinking session to get to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400311"
            ]
          },
          "413400311": {
            "id": "413400311",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Hahaha, oh, don't worry about me. I'm not some old fogey!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400312"
            ]
          },
          "413400312": {
            "id": "413400312",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Still, thanks for the concern. I'll be careful."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134005",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400501": {
            "id": "413400501",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Ah, it's you. Have you finished that Xiao Lantern?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400502"
            ]
          },
          "413400502": {
            "id": "413400502",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Here it is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400503"
            ]
          },
          "413400503": {
            "id": "413400503",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Thank you ever so much."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134006",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400601": {
            "id": "413400601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "This lantern is both well-shaped and sturdy. Heh, my craftsmanship pales in comparison to yours...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400602"
            ]
          },
          "413400602": {
            "id": "413400602",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "In that case, we'll release this lantern later at night. I know a good spot.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400603"
            ]
          },
          "413400603": {
            "id": "413400603",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "In the meantime, I need to think of what I should wish for..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134007",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Herbalist Gui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400401": {
            "id": "413400401",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Thanks for your help. Have all the medicines been delivered?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400404"
            ]
          },
          "413400404": {
            "id": "413400404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Well, there's not much we can do about that. Stomach problems won't go away unless you watch your lifestyle. The best we can do is treat the symptoms whenever they show up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400405"
            ]
          },
          "413400405": {
            "id": "413400405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "But I suppose that I can rest easy for now, at least...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400406"
            ]
          },
          "413400406": {
            "id": "413400406",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, what about Xiao Lanterns...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400407"
            ]
          },
          "413400407": {
            "id": "413400407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Oh... We don't generally release lanterns. The whole point of Xiao Lanterns is to make a wish, right? Well... What sort of wish would Bubu Pharmacy even make?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400408"
            ]
          },
          "413400408": {
            "id": "413400408",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Other businesses may wish for their business to thrive and boom, but a pharmacy is in the business of curing disease and saving lives... we can't exactly wish for more sick people, can we?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134008",
      "subQuestName": "Make a Xiao Lantern for Herbalist Gui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400801": {
            "id": "413400801",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "As for my wish... I ultimately wished for everyone in Liyue to be healthy and well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400802"
            ]
          },
          "413400802": {
            "id": "413400802",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "And as for Bubu Pharmacy's business?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400803"
            ]
          },
          "413400803": {
            "id": "413400803",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Well, this was my personal wish, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400804"
            ]
          },
          "413400804": {
            "id": "413400804",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "I put prescriptions together because I do not wish for people to be tormented by illness.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400805"
            ]
          },
          "413400805": {
            "id": "413400805",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "There's an old saying that sums this up nicely: \"Dusty old medicine sat on the shelf, a small price to pay for a world of good health.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400806"
            ]
          },
          "413400806": {
            "id": "413400806",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Not to mention that I'd be less busy if everyone remained healthy! That'd be a good thing, in my books...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400807"
            ]
          },
          "413400807": {
            "id": "413400807",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "...Oh no! I've suddenly remembered! There's still a customer I haven't delivered medicine to...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400808"
            ]
          },
          "413400808": {
            "id": "413400808",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "I'm sorry — I have to go! Happy Lantern Rite!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134009",
      "subQuestName": "Give a Xiao Lantern to Herbalist Gui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400901": {
            "id": "413400901",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Where are Baizhu and Qiqi?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400902"
            ]
          },
          "413400902": {
            "id": "413400902",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Qiqi went out to gather some herbs and still isn't back yet... It's highly possible that she might have gotten lost somewhere due to her poor memory again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400903"
            ]
          },
          "413400903": {
            "id": "413400903",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "As for Dr. Baizhu, I think he's probably doing some medical research or something else of that nature. Either way, it's not my place to ask."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134010",
      "subQuestName": "Report back to Herbalist Gui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134011",
      "subQuestName": "Wait until the following night (20 – 24)",
      "sceneId": null,
