    {
      "subId": "4134013",
      "subQuestName": "Head to the designated location to look for Herbalist Gui",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400701": {
            "id": "413400701",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Ah, you're here. I've already written my wish on the lantern.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400702"
            ]
          },
          "413400702": {
            "id": "413400702",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "This is good timing... Let's release this lantern."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134012",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413401201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413401201": {
            "id": "413401201",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "I wonder if we have enough herbs left..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134001",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413400101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413400101": {
            "id": "413400101",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "I'm sorry to trouble you during this festive time, Traveler, but we're a little in over our heads at the moment. The number of people requiring medicine from Bubu Pharmacy always peaks during the Lantern Rite period.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400102"
            ]
          },
          "413400102": {
            "id": "413400102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Why does that happen...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400103"
            ]
          },
          "413400103": {
            "id": "413400103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "During the Lantern Rite, everyone puts their work aside to spend time with their families. Of course, there will be all manner of banquets, with fine food and drink flowing all around...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400104"
            ]
          },
          "413400104": {
            "id": "413400104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Suddenly, everyone's got indigestion, or else they're coming down with some malady or other...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400105"
            ]
          },
          "413400105": {
            "id": "413400105",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "I'm always encouraging people to not eat too much, but during a food-driven festival like this, my advice tends to fall on deaf ears.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400106"
            ]
          },
          "413400106": {
            "id": "413400106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Just now, a few more customers contacted me, asking if I could bring them some medicine for indigestion and other stomach problems. But I can't simply stop manning the pharmacy...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413400107"
            ]
          },
          "413400107": {
            "id": "413400107",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Traveler, if it's alright with you, could you help me deliver some medicine?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134010",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413401001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413401001": {
            "id": "413401001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Isn't there anyone else who can help?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "413401002"
            ]
          },
          "413401002": {
            "id": "413401002",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Well... No one else at the pharmacy is free at the moment..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134013",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413401301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413401301": {
            "id": "413401301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "Hmm, how many more deliveries of medicine do we need to make..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134015",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413401501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413401501": {
            "id": "413401501",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Guanhai",
            "text": "Ahh, that's much better... Now, what should I eat later, I wonder?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4134016",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "413401601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "413401601": {
            "id": "413401601",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Herbalist Gui",
            "text": "What should I wish for..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}